concept:australian-capital-territory-evidence-temporary-provisions-act-1971-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Validation of provisions of Australian Capital Territory Evidence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Ordinance  (1) The provisions of the Australian Capital Territory Evidence Ordinance 1971 contained in Australian Capital Territory Ordinance No. 4 of 1971 shall, notwithstanding its disallowance by the Senate, continue in force.  (2) Nothing in subsection (1) prevents the amendment or repeal by an Ordinance under the Seat of Government (Administration) Act 1910 of the provisions continued in force by that subsection.  (3) The Interpretation Ordinance 1967 of the Australian Capital Territory, as amended and in force from time to time, applies, and shall be deemed to have always applied, to the provisions continued in force by subsection (1).   Endnotes  Endnote 1—Legislation history  Australian Capital Territory Evidence (Temporary Provisions) Act 1971  Endnotes  Endnote 1—Legislation history This endnote sets out details of the legislation history of the Australian Capital Territory Evidence (Temporary Provisions) Act 1971.  Act Number and year Assent Commencement Application, saving and transitional provisions Australian Capital Territory Evidence (Temporary Provisions) Act 1971 66, 1971" ;
    skos:definition "Ordinance  (1) The provisions of the Australian Capital Territory Evidence Ordinance 1971 contained in Australian Capital Territory Ordinance No. 4 of 1971 shall, notwithstanding its disallowance by the Senate, continue in force.  (2) Nothing in subsection (1) prevents the amendment or repeal by an Ordinance under the Seat of Government (Administration) Act 1910 of the provisions continued in force by that subsection.  (3) The Interpretation Ordinance 1967 of the Australian Capital Territory, as amended and in force from time to time, applies, and shall be deemed to have always applied, to the provisions continued in force by subsection (1).   Endnotes  Endnote 1—Legislation history  Australian Capital Territory Evidence (Temporary Provisions) Act 1971  Endnotes  Endnote 1—Legislation history This endnote sets out details of the legislation history of the Australian Capital Territory Evidence (Temporary Provisions) Act 1971.  Act Number and year Assent Commencement Application, saving and transitional provisions Australian Capital Territory Evidence (Temporary Provisions) Act 1971 66, 1971"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ea25011e7d47d9b42ea07cb885edc972db18695f8c2038ebfc051ab265d38e8e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "5"^^xsd:integer ;
